{"query":"Airavat By Bhoomi Group  official site amenities","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://bhoomiairavat.co","title":"Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West, Mumbai | Luxury 3 & 4 BHK Deck Apartments","content":"## \n\nBhoomi Airavat offers 45+ amenities including a swimming pool, gymnasium, yoga & meditation zone, Miyawaki garden, jogging track, cricket turf, multipurpose sports court, indoor games, banquet hall, children's play area, senior citizen corner and 24x7 security.\n\n## \n\nBhoomi Airavat is developed by Bhoomi Group (Bhoomi Shashwat Estate Private Limited), with 33+ years of experience, 50 delivered projects, 15,000+ happy families and over 1 crore sq.ft developed.\n\nCall  Enquire)  WhatsApp\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n We Promise\n Instant Call Back\n Free Site Visit\n Unmatched Price\n\n##### Get information on availabilities\n\nAvailable units\n\nPayment plan\n\nFloor plans\n\n##### Descriptive brochure\n\nFloor plans [...] Bhoomi Airavat 3 BHK Deck Floor Plan - 1184 Sq.ft3 BHK Deck · 1184 Sq.ft\n Bhoomi Airavat 4 BHK Deck Floor Plan - 1556 Sq.ft4 BHK Deck · 1556 Sq.ft\n Bhoomi Airavat Jodi Apartment Floor Plan - 2368 Sq.ftJodi · 2368 Sq.ft\n Bhoomi Airavat Duplex Floor Plan - 5308 Sq.ftDuplex · 5308 Sq.ft\n Bhoomi Airavat Duplex Floor Plan - 3734 Sq.ftDuplex · 3734 Sq.ft\n Bhoomi Airavat Penthouse Upper Level Floor PlanPenthouse / Upper Level\n Bhoomi Airavat Typical Floor Plan - 6 Homes Per FloorTypical Floor Plan\n\n### World-Class Amenities\n\nA resort-inspired lifestyle with 45+ ultra-luxury amenities designed for every age group.\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nGymnasium\n\nYoga & Meditation\n\nMiyawaki Garden\n\nJogging Track\n\nCricket Turf\n\nSports Court\n\nIndoor Games\n\nBanquet Hall\n\nKids’ Play Area\n\nSenior Citizen Corner [...] Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West - Twilight Tower View\n Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West - 38-Storey Elevation Front View\n Bhoomi Airavat - Borivali's Tallest 38-Storey Landmark\n\n# Bhoomi Airavat\n\n## At Sai Baba Nagar, Borivali West\n\n### By Bhoomi Group · Near Gurudwara\n\n|  |  |\n --- |\n| Tower | 38 Storeys |\n| Residences | 198 (6/Floor) |\n| Possession | Dec 2030 |\n\n Private Deck in Every Home\n Only 6 Homes Per Floor\n 11 ft Floor-to-Ceiling Height\n Grand Double-Height Lobby\n 45+ Lifestyle Amenities\n Near Gurudwara & Upcoming Metro\n\n#### Luxurious 3 & 4 BHK Deck Residences Start At\n\n##### ₹ 5.33 Cr\\\n\n###### RERA : PM1180002600498\n\nOrganize Site Visit)  +91 9136936949\n\n##### Enquire Now\n\nFree Pickup and Drop service for Bhoomi Airavat site visit","score":0.8687491,"raw_content":null,"id":"4d031a-00"},{"url":"https://www.theluxuryproject.in/residential/bhoomi-airavat","title":"BHOOMI AIRAVAT| BHOOMI AIRAVAT SAI BABA NAGAR BORIVALI WEST ONGOING PROJECT","content":"Experience a rare combination of luxury, exclusivity, lifetime open views, premium deck residences, and unmatched connectivity in the heart of Borivali West. Bhoomi Airavat is more than a home—it's a statement address crafted for those who aspire to live above the ordinary. 🏙️✨\n\n##### AMENITIES : BHOOMI AIRAVAT NEAR GURUDWARA SAI BABA NAGAR BORIVALI WEST\n\n🌟 World-Class Lifestyle Amenities at Bhoomi Airavat 🌟\n\nExperience a lifestyle where luxury, wellness, recreation, and relaxation come together in one iconic address.\n\n🏊‍♂️ Resort-Style Swimming Pool\n\nUnwind after a long day or enjoy refreshing mornings at the beautifully designed swimming pool, offering a premium resort-like experience within your residence.\n\n🏋️‍♀️ State-of-the-Art Fitness Centre [...] 👴 Senior Citizen Relaxation Zone\n\nA thoughtfully planned area providing comfort, leisure, and social interaction for senior residents in a peaceful environment.\n\n🏛️ Grand Entrance Lobby\n\nExperience luxury from the moment you arrive with a magnificent double-height entrance lobby that reflects elegance and sophistication.\n\n🔒 Advanced Security & Safety\n\nEnjoy complete peace of mind with round-the-clock security surveillance, controlled access systems, and professionally managed safety measures.\n\n🌟 45+ Ultra-Luxury Lifestyle Amenities\n\nBhoomi Airavat offers an extensive collection of premium lifestyle amenities designed to cater to every age group, ensuring a holistic living experience for the entire family. [...] Exclusive Options Available\n\n✨ Jodi Apartments  \n ✨ Duplex Homes  \n ✨ Triplex Residences  \n ✨ Luxury Penthouses\n\nPrivate decks attached to every residence offer breathtaking views and create the perfect space for relaxation, entertaining guests, or enjoying peaceful mornings above the city skyline.\n\n💎 Borivali West's Largest Lifestyle Amenity Zone\n\nExperience a resort-inspired lifestyle with 45+ premium amenities designed for every age group.\n\nLifestyle & Wellness\n\n🏊 Swimming Pool  \n 🏋️ State-of-the-Art Gymnasium  \n 🧘 Yoga & Meditation Zone  \n 🌳 Miyawaki Garden  \n 🛤️ Jogging Track\n\nRecreation & Entertainment\n\n🎯 Indoor Games Room  \n ⭐ Banquet Hall  \n 🏏 Cricket Turf  \n ⛹️ Multipurpose Sports Court\n\nFamily Spaces\n\n🛝 Children's Play Area  \n 👵 Senior Citizen Corner\n\nSafety & Convenience","score":0.83452857,"raw_content":null,"id":"04e11b-01"},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/bhoomi-airavat","title":"Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","content":"This project offers 24+ amenities. Key external amenities include Walking Track, Gymnasium, Indoor games, Jacuzzi, and Hammock Garden.  \n Internal specifications include Stainless Steel Sink and Granite Kitchen Platform. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Bhoomi Airavat, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• 1184 sq. ft.  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your 